    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Print the individual or group form, or pick one up at the Kenn Borek Aquatic Centre or Culture & Recreation front desk\n  2. Fill out the main applicant section\n  3. Ask a Trusted Partner to fill out the bottom section\n  4. Email the form or drop it off at the aquatic centre or Kin Arena\nWhat you need:\n  - The completed application form\n  - The bottom section completed by a Trusted Partner, verifying income and residency\nPractical tips:\n  - A Trusted Partner is a social service agency, government agency or non-profit you work with.\n  - Applicants are told by mail, up to three weeks after the deadline.\n  - You can apply again, but funding is limited each calendar year.\nHow long it takes (verified — you may state this): Up to three weeks after the deadline",
