    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Fill out the Affordable Access Program Application Form.\n  2. Add the required income verification.\n  3. Submit it in person at the North West Leisure Centre, Sportplex or Sandra Schmirler Leisure Centre, or by email, fax or mail.\n  4. If approved, buy transit passes at the Transit Information Centre, 2124 11th Avenue.\nWhat you need:\n  - Completed application form\n  - Income verification\nPractical tips:\n  - Processing takes about three weeks on average, so apply early.\n  - Passes that are already discounted (Discount, Post-Secondary, Senior) do not get the extra [percentage — see the guide] off.\nHow long it takes (verified — you may state this): About three weeks to process",
