    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Apply online, or get a form at a Service New Brunswick location.\n  2. Apply any time until Dec. 31.\n  3. For details, email LISB-PAFR@snb.ca.\nWhat you need:\n  - The application form\nPractical tips:\n  - The page shows 2026 information; ask whether the amount changes for later years.\n  - Call the toll-free line if you are unsure whether you qualify.",
