    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Call the toll-free number to talk with the team.\n  2. The team answers questions and points you to community resources.\n  3. They support you through the Disability Support Program application.\nWhat you need:\n  - The pages do not list documents. Ask the team what to bring.\nPractical tips:\n  - Visit a Community Services office Monday to Friday, 8:30 am to 4:30 pm.\n  - The full Flex and Independent Living Support policies are on each program page.",
