    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Check the income limit for your area and bedrooms.\n  2. Apply through the online portal or at any District Office.\n  3. Update your household and income details every year.\nWhat you need:\n  - Proof of Nova Scotia residency\n  - Social insurance number\n  - Proof of citizenship or permanent residency\nPractical tips:\n  - District Offices are Metro, Western, Northern and Cape Breton.\n  - Update your application when your household or contact details change."
