    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Open the PROKids page and get the application form.\n  2. Count your family size: parents in the household plus children [age limit — see the guide].\n  3. Add your most recent Notice of Assessment for each parent or guardian, or an endorsement.\n  4. Ask Town of Bridgewater Recreation staff how to submit the form.\nWhat you need:\n  - Most recent tax year Notice of Assessment, one for each parent or guardian\n  - Or an endorsement from the Department of Community Services or Indigenous Assistance\nPractical tips:\n  - Lunenburg District and Chester District residents use their own municipality's form.\n  - KidSport and Canadian Tire Jumpstart are other options for help with fees.",
