    "text": "How to apply:\n  1. Apply for the Rental Housing Program.\n  2. If approved, find a home yourself or ask NLHC for a list of interested landlords.\n  3. NLHC inspects the home before you move in.\n  4. Get a transfer approved and the new unit inspected before any later move.\nWhat you need:\n  - The sheet does not list documents; NLHC uses your application information.\nPractical tips:\n  - Income limit is [amount — see the guide] or less, or [amount — see the guide] in Labrador West and the North Coast of Labrador.\n  - Your share of rent is [percentage — see the guide] of net income.\n  - The sheet's example: net income of [amount — see the guide] and rent of [amount — see the guide] gives a monthly benefit of about [amount — see the guide].\n  - Rent Supplement clients were to be converted to this program as agreements expire, 2023 through 2026.\n  - Check current figures, and whether the benefit is open, with NLHC; this sheet was uploaded in 2023."
